Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.40,0:00:10.23,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.1\fade(250,250)}I think it's time to blow this scene
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.23,0:00:12.50,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.1\fade(250,250)}Get everybody and their stuff together
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.50,0:00:14.99,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.1\fade(250,0)}Okay, three, two, one let's jam
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.37,0:02:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The elders are going to be on the move.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.84,0:02:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It is dangerous over there as well.{\i0} {9 frames but made it 10}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.49,0:02:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Please hurry.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.31,0:03:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What a foolish act you have done.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.29,0:03:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The fortuneteller told us thus.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.29,0:03:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,"The night of the red moon,\Nthe snake will slither
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.33,0:03:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,horribly quickly to make\Nuse of its venomous fangs."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.55,0:03:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You look so pitiful, Vicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.30,0:03:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,We have informed you of our decision\Nthat you cannot be our successor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.00,0:03:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The syndicate does not need\Ncorpses who cannot even fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.49,0:03:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,That arrogance of yours will\Nruin everything in the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.83,0:03:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Take him to the punishment chamber.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.45,0:03:51.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.59,0:03:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.22,0:03:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You cannot choose how you will die.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.68,0:03:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,After we let you have a good\Ntaste of humiliation,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.76,0:04:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,we will send you into the underworld.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.70,0:04:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't forget...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.18,0:04:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,a snake's venom poisons\Nslowly after the bite.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.47,0:04:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Sheesh, that was the first time\Nwe screwed up so badly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.73,0:04:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We never had anything like that before
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.67,0:04:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,when we were all alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.46,0:04:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,All told, they screwed up\Nour plans right to the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.23,0:04:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,They really were like troublesome babies.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.71,0:04:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I completely understand why\Nyou hate women and kids now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.37,0:05:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Too much vermouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.15,0:05:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.80,0:05:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Lin?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.86,0:05:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Shin, his younger brother. {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.63,0:05:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Shin...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.99,0:05:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, you two were...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.28,0:05:48.49,Default,,0,0,0,,If you change sides, you won't be\Nable to return to the syndicate.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.03,0:05:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.27,0:05:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Vicious is to be executed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.52,0:05:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,He failed to pull off the coup, and has\Nbeen put under restraints by the elders.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.71,0:05:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You are in danger as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.35,0:06:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,And Miss Julia...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.98,0:06:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Julia is?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.61,0:06:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,They're in the city of Tharsis.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.08,0:06:09.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll hold them off here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.59,0:06:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Please go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.42,0:06:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll owe you one, Shin!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.08,0:06:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what happened to Red Dragon,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.08,0:06:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,but it's not really\Nyour problem now, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.93,0:06:44.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Vicious, Julia...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.39,0:06:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,To me, both those names\Nsound nothing but ominous.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.02,0:06:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like a magic spell that opens\Na door that shouldn't be opened.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.77,0:06:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You're...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.68,0:06:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold still.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.56,0:07:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You are no longer a member\Nof the syndicate...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.74,0:07:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.62,0:07:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.65,0:07:20.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget everything, including\Nthe fact that we came here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.23,0:07:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.84,0:07:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just treating stray cats\Nthat wandered into the office.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.74,0:07:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Stray cats that I can't ever get rid of...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.88,0:07:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,When this is over,\NI'm leaving the syndicate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.13,0:07:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.65,0:07:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll let them say I'm dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.47,0:08:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be waiting at the graveyard.\NOf course, I will be alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.65,0:08:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I... can't come with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.46,0:08:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.03,0:08:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll leave here...\NWe'll escape from this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.71,0:08:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And then what are we going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.60,0:08:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll just live a life of freedom somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.65,0:08:27.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like watching a dream...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.93,0:08:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Are you going to betray me?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.63,0:08:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you going to leave this world?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.14,0:08:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Vicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.92,0:08:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if it's a dream,\Nthat's an impossibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.87,0:09:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you going to kill him?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.03,0:09:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.14,0:09:06.27,Default,,0,0,0,,with your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.84,0:09:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You stay alive
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.64,0:09:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,or you both die.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.03,0:09:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You can choose.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.41,0:09:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,So there is no place for me after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.33,0:09:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't go no matter who\Ncomes to pick me up. Never.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.04,0:10:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to live a life where\NI'm always in someone's way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.69,0:10:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom! I've been looking for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.66,0:10:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Alfred...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.70,0:10:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you to wait in front\Nof the curry restaurant!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.51,0:10:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.93,0:10:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all right. I'm glad you came.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.67,0:10:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It sounds too good to be true that\Nyou can take care of me now. {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.98,0:10:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom, I want to live with you. {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.21,0:10:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You found a job?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.51,0:10:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.92,0:10:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What about your female co-host?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.05,0:10:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm? I heard she's getting married.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.13,0:10:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Something about this...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.67,0:10:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Where are you now?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.76,0:10:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.25,0:11:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm heading out to the city of Tharsis.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.53,0:11:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You should head that way, too.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.03,0:11:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.34,0:11:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's hard for Jet to get around on his own.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.70,0:11:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Especially after\Ngetting shot in the leg.{\i0} {3 frames extra lead-in}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.99,0:11:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm telling ya to stop wandering{\i0}\N{\i1}around so much, and just come back.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.56,0:11:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't just assume that I'm coming back!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.86,0:11:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got to be kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.42,0:11:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a place to go back to!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.28,0:11:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with that attitude?\NLike he's all high-and-mighty. {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.99,0:11:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What does he mean, Jet's by himself?\NHe's there... Ed and Ein, too... {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.02,0:12:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.48,0:12:34.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Same here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.23,0:12:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a good shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.71,0:12:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I was getting bounties with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.75,0:12:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,A bounty hunter?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.59,0:12:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Although now...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.82,0:12:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm kind of on a break 'cause\Nthere's something going on. {extra lead-out}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.71,0:12:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You look like you have\Nsomething going on, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.93,0:12:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It might be good to pair up\Nwith another woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.68,0:12:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,How about it? Wanna be my partner?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.09,0:13:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I have... something to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.63,0:13:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.72,0:13:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.61,0:13:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know any bounty hunter hangouts?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.80,0:13:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I can help if you want to put\Na bounty on someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.94,0:13:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm looking for a bounty hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.55,0:13:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll drive you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.71,0:13:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.21,0:13:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Faye...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.67,0:13:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Faye?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.78,0:13:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Faye Valentine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.57,0:13:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,A common name.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.72,0:13:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What's yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.34,0:13:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Julia.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.56,0:13:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Julia?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.88,0:13:41.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a common name.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.57,0:13:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad I met you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.07,0:13:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.21,0:13:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, have I seen you somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.92,0:14:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,If... you see Spike again...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.36,0:14:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell him that I will be waiting there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.20,0:14:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll know what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.62,0:14:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell him that I'll keep waiting...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.03,0:14:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,How? {Original: "Why?"}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.43,0:14:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Faye Valentine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.94,0:14:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,How? {Original: "Why?"}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.82,0:14:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you know?! {Original: "What for?!" Dub: "How do you know I know Spike?"}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.28,0:14:56.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Does it still hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.57,0:15:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know a story that goes like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.63,0:15:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,A man injured his leg during a hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.92,0:15:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,In the middle of the savanna,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.14,0:15:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,with no means to treat the wound,\Nthe leg rots, and death approaches.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.37,0:15:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The man got onto the airplane\Nthat finally arrived,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.55,0:15:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,and there he sees a land\Nof pure white below him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.00,0:15:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The place glistening in the light was\Nthe summit of a snow-covered mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.88,0:15:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,The name of the mountain was Kilimanjaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.95,0:15:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The man thinks
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.74,0:15:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,that was where he was headed...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.69,0:15:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And...?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.37,0:15:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate this story.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.41,0:15:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Men only think about the past\Nright before their death,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.54,0:15:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,as if they were searching frantically\Nfor proof that they were alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.38,0:15:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Turn back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.04,0:16:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You told me when we first met
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.60,0:16:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,that you were a man who\Nhad already died once.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.60,0:16:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Just forget the past, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.93,0:16:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,There was a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.79,0:16:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,For the first time in my life
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.36,0:16:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw a woman that was truly alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.75,0:16:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I believed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.32,0:16:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,She was a piece of me I had lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.57,0:16:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,She is my other half that I had longed for.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.75,0:16:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,She's back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.71,0:16:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm? Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.95,0:16:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.94,0:16:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not a repair shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.36,0:16:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't come back just when\Nyou broke something...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.33,0:16:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.81,0:16:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,He?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.87,0:16:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The one with the fluffy hair. {extra lead-in}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.99,0:16:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What, can't you just say\Nyou're looking for Spike?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.53,0:16:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.32,0:16:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,He's in the workshop.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.21,0:17:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you trying to hide?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.11,0:17:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You came back here just to see Spike?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.96,0:17:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I was asked to relay a message
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.31,0:17:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,,from Julia.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.94,0:17:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.89,0:17:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Jet, it's me.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.22,0:17:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What, I don't have any information now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.24,0:17:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not really able to—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.44,0:17:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm glad you're all right.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.15,0:17:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I was worried. It's getting{\i0}\N{\i1}to be pretty bad, you know...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.31,0:17:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,About Red Dragon?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.44,0:17:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yeah... There was apparently\Na coup two days ago{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.70,0:17:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}concerning who was going to be{\i0}\N{\i1}the syndicate's successor.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.64,0:17:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}In the end, the elders won,{\i0}\N{\i1}and they're now out to {\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.45,0:17:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}annihilate anyone who{\i0}\N{\i1}was involved in the coup.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.94,0:17:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Your partner will also...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.87,0:17:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Been there. But why are they trying to get rid of\Nthose that already left the syndicate?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.26,0:17:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Anything against them will be\Nannihilated, down to the very last seed.{\i0} {extra lead-in}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.23,0:17:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's how they do it.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.57,0:17:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the worst logic I've ever heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.63,0:17:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Just run. The police can't handle all of it.{\i0} {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.50,0:17:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Leave Mars.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.27,0:18:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Too late for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.00,0:18:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You have something?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.71,0:18:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You look like you have some information.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.48,0:18:33.19,Default,,0,0,0,,How much will you pay for it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.19,0:18:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have any money.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.48,0:18:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure came back at the worst time...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.47,0:18:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Weren't you the one who called me here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.46,0:18:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Or... maybe they followed you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.40,0:18:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, well. It was gonna\Nhappen sooner or later. {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.66,0:18:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.89,0:19:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.92,0:19:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have any money.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.62,0:19:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,She said she'll be waiting there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.86,0:19:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,She said you'd understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.12,0:19:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.05,0:19:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Her name was Julia. {11 frames. Original: "It was from a woman named Julia."}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.42,0:19:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone was after her...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.09,0:19:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,They were chasing her... {3 frames extra lead-out}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.09,0:19:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Jet, I can go at any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.07,0:19:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You who caused a disturbance\Nin our clan's affairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.57,0:19:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,By the will of the clan, you shall be executed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.31,0:19:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me out, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.09,0:19:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.45,0:19:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Your right thruster isn't working yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.22,0:20:01.93,Default,,0,0,0,,The end is the same if\Nwe go down ship and all!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.93,0:20:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you leave words?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.68,0:20:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Or leave something material?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.11,0:20:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.76,0:21:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You shall shed red tears.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.43,0:21:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Spike, can you still fly?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.92,0:21:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about us. Just go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.41,0:21:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Go grasp that thing you had lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.16,0:21:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Go!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.66,0:21:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,As of now, the leadership\Nhas changed hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.88,0:21:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,From now on, I will dictate all authority\Nand symbolism of this syndicate.
