Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.21,0:23:54.95,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\bord3\blur4\3c&H483335&\c&H483335&\fade(250,250)}if it ends after the first time
Dialogue: 1,0:23:46.21,0:23:54.95,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\c&HD1C4C5&\blur0.5\fade(250,250)}if it ends after the first time
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.68,0:24:13.47,Default,,0,0,0,,A lot of things have happened,\Nbut the next episode is the last.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.08,0:24:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It sure was long...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.45,0:24:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Feels like it's finally over... So how was it, Jet? {original: "No use doing this... So how was it, Jet?"}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.49,0:24:17.93,Default - Alt,,0,0,0,,The past is the past and the future is the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.93,0:24:21.37,Default - Alt,,0,0,0,,A man is a man, and a woman is a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.49,0:24:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Because of you, I ended up raising Ein.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.37,0:24:22.68,Default - Alt,,0,0,0,,Now is now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.68,0:24:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Dogs are really cute after all...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.68,0:24:25.87,Default - Alt,,0,0,0,,I am who I am, and you are who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.25,0:24:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Jet. Come on, you aren't
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.87,0:24:31.08,Default - Alt,,0,0,0,,Like it really matters any...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.24,0:24:29.66,Default - Overlap,,0,0,0,,I wonder why we gave him away...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.66,0:24:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,listening to what I'm saying at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.08,0:24:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh... What was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.95,0:24:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Never mind. {extra lead-in}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.88,0:24:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway... Next episode:\NThe Real Folk Blues (Part 2).
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.95,0:24:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see you again, somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.54,0:24:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What? This is the end?
